THREADS: yes. On all 16 cores (a) a compact search takes +52.3 ms at 100,000 and +43.4 ms at 200,000 and +36.4 ms at 500,000 and +34.2 ms at 1,000,000 vectors more than on one core each (d) and again after all the others (k) +57.1 ms at 100,000 and +57.7 ms at 200,000 and +28.7 ms at 500,000 and +31.7 ms at 1,000,000; the exact search +1.8 ms and +1.8 ms and +2.6 ms and -8.4 ms.
